        "procedure": "Shared Fe10Ln10 synthesis: Fe(NO3)3·9H2O (0.202 g, 0.5 mmol), Ln(NO3)3·6H2O (0.5 mmol) and Me-teaH3 (0.326 g, 2.0 mmol) were dissolved in MeCN/MeOH (25/10 mL) and stirred at 50 °C for 10 min. NEt3 (0.3 mL) was added dropwise (brown to yellow-orange), the mixture was heated to boiling, filtered, and left in air. Heavier-lanthanide members crystallize within 24 h (yields 26–57%); lighter members required Et2O vapour diffusion (yields 10–17%).",
